candidate_text:
Position: Computational Linguist
Moreinfo: My recent experiences mostly concern jobs in Linguistics and research (including internships) that align with my latest degree - Master's in Language Science. I contributed to the projects of such scientific centres as :
- ATILF (Computer Processing and Analysis of the French Language) in France;
- CiTIUS (Center for Research in Intelligent Technologies) in Spain;
- Leibniz Institute for the German Language in Germany.
Before enrolling for my linguistic Master, I worked in project coordination, business development, technical customer support and translation. In all of my positions, I collaborated with international colleagues and customers and implemented my English (C1) and German (C1) skills. Experiences to highlight:
- Exchange programme coordination at ICYE, Bern, Switzerland (1 year);
- Technical customer support agent with German at Euroanswer SRL - HP Smart, Kyiv, Ukraine (6 months);
- Customer Care with German at Livingston Research LTD, Kyiv, Ukraine (6 months).
Looking For: Ideally, I would like to collaborate on projects connected with NLP and other branches of AI and ML. I have recently accomplished a course in NLP with Python and started a bootcamp in Data Engineering. I would like to expand my knowledge & skills in these two areas as an intern or a junior-level developer.
Highlights: - English (C1), German (C1), French (B2), Ukrainian (native), Russian (native);
- Python skills for NLP tasks;
- Scholarship from the European Commission for Master studies.
