Position: CFO, Finance Director
Moreinfo: Self-starter, motivated and striving for success professional. Proving record of growing Private Equity backed businesses in different industries (telecommunications, manufacturing, FMCG, luxury retail, IT). Possess structured and strategic thinking and problem solving skills, especially in dynamic and fast-paced business environment. Committed to team development and leading them to deliver high performance outcomes. Deadline-oriented, diligent, experienced in working with/in cross-functional teams and multicultural environment, possessing strong multi-tasking skills, capable to adapt to new challenges and ideas. 
CFO outsourcing, Financial and Business Consultant – Consulting services for IT (gambling IT development).   
•	The financial planning process: budgeting and forecasting, strategic planning, tax planning, financial modelling for business development pitching;
•	Individual Entrepreneurs (IE) support (setting up, banking support, reporting, etc.);
•	Development of the financial and tax strategies, financial and legal structuring, operations (finance and accounting, including foreign entities), compliance and reporting;
•	Foreign companies set up, bank accounts opening and support, payments; outsourcing of accounting, auditing, reporting, legal issues. etc.;
•	Managing budgets and cash flow, accounting, payroll, cost calculation/comprehensive analysis for decision making, business units’ performance analysis, P&L Management, ;
ACHIEVEMENTS:
•	Have built the Finance Department from scratch, including IE support;
•	The working relationships with European banking institutions have been established (compliance issues), the accounting, audit and reporting process has been set up for foreign entities in Austria, Slovakia, Malta, Bulgaria and Hong Kong;
•	Support for Business Development team on financial matters, forecasting, etc.;
•	Implemented from scratch the budgeting ERP system, treasury, payroll;
•	Expenses control and optimization, financial business proces
