candidate_text:
Position: Account Executive/ Business Development Manager
Moreinfo: Results-oriented and hands-on professional with more than ten years of experience in Business Development, Sales, Account Executive, Customer care, Lead Generation, Deal Closing, and Business Process Building areas. I help the business to grow by providing Business Development and IT Sales Consulting Services.

I follow the rule "Each Client is the most important Client!"

As a team player, I also get the most satisfaction lifting companies to the next level by establishing company presence at online, offline events, and related Internet platforms. I receive satisfaction by seeing the company evolution when I find a perfect match and bring new Partners and Clients.
I'm excellent at Product selling; Presenting product demo; 
Building long-term relationships with new and existing customers; Great analytical skills; Keen on details; Identifying sales leads; Bringing back churned clients; Lead nurturing; Setting up sales and business processes from scratch;  Achieving sales targets; Automatization of the business processes inside the team;  Building partnership with other IT corporations;

Have additional experience of working as Account and Customer Success Manager;

I have a valid 10-year USA visa (B1/B2), as well as an extensive visa history.
Looking For: I'm looking for work in an international Product company.
Opportunity for personal and financial growth. I'm okay with business trips, participation in conferences, and global meetups. 

I expect less bureaucracy, more teamwork between departments in order to achieve mutual goals.
Highlights: Established cooperation for the companies I worked for with several world-famous corporations;
Brought numerous long term projects for mine and Partner companies;
Brought 7 new Reseller companies from countries we didn't have representatives before;
I brought projects for more than 3M$;
Brought several big Enterprise companies into our Client's portfolio;
Launched and developed the partnership networks from scratch;
Increased companies revenue (from 15 to 60%) by bringing new projects and clients;
Increased the number of loyal company customers and partners;
Successfully back lost and churned Clients;
Helped to determine companies' niche to exceed competitors;
By having good analytical skills, I found out weak points and set up new processes in Sales Teams; 
I represented the company at the biggest IT world conferences and I brought x3 times more leads in comparison with previous years;
Brought long-term projects (including IoT, AI, Data Science, Healthcare, etc);
I was the Mentor of the Global Compact Network in Ukraine ( United Nations Organization's project);
Recently, I'm one of the organizers' series of match-making events between Ukrainian IT talents and Belgian IT companies, in Belgium.
