Before Aitheon, I was holding the position of Head of Sales in DEOL Partners company, (the operation and management company of different hospitality brands) for 3,5 years. 

My main responsibilities were:
- Developing a goal-oriented, motivated, high-functioning sales team of 5 members: providing guidance, counsel and support;
- Overseeing the daily team operations: rate contracts negotiations, new business contacts opportunities, maintaining a portfolio of key accounts across the team, etc;
- Establishing a revenue forecast for financial periods; building an annual cost budget of the department; cost control;
- Monthly analysis of the Profit and Loss statements to define the strategy towards maximizing the ROI;
- Negotiation with potential investors and property owners to expand the company’s property portfolio;
- Developing a Sales Strategy of potential properties: building and business potential analysis, market and comp set research, revenue forecasting for Fin Model as a component of LOI. 

Looking forward to talking with my future manager!
I desperately need cool projects, a great team, and clear goals. The company I'm looking for is the place where I can apply all my skills, contribute desire, efforts, and time to achieve the highest peaks for the company!

Moreinfo:
10+ years experience in the sector of technologies and solutions with sales on enterprise level in multinational corporation with 150+ offices worldwide. You'll gain most effect if I lead what i'm doing the best:
- Business development (strategy for growing from scratch, new markets, new niches, new customer clusters, new distribution channels);
- Sales (B2B, ABM, negotiations, farming new partners/customers, long term and high value global deals, sales management, battle for marketshare);
- Project management (customer business migration to our technology platform involving hundreds of staff and offices locally and worldwide, launch of locally designed and supported products with distribution on new markets worldwide, local distribution of global solutions);
- Key Account Management (management of global and high value customers, client relationship management, CRM, cross sales).

Degrees in Psychology and in Diplomacy + years of experience perform my strong skills of negotiator, relationship builder and deal closer. This best fits for relationship management and building the trust and the confidence with clients. And this is the way for success and long term cooperation. 

MBA + years of experience in business management perform my skills of strong team player, manager of business processes and decision maker in highly competitive environment.

candidate_text:
Position: Business Development Manager / Sales Manager
Moreinfo: Working in IT outsourcing companies as a Business Development Manager for the past years, with clients from all over the world, I had a chance to expand my skills in different areas - communication, negotiations, presentation, as well as I've got experience in management of lead generation campaigns combining it with sales. 

As a Business Development Manager, I have been involved in numerous presentation calls and pre-sales meetings with clients,  identifying their needs and prepared the best proposals for them.

• Management of full sales cycle in B2B;

• Searching for new clients - lead generation;

• Building of long-term relationships with new and existing customers (negotiations, presentation of services, pre-sales meetings, price negotiations, conclusion/revision of contracts, control of payment, reporting);

• Customer support and solving of conflict situations (payment disputes, deadlines matching, discussion of reducing costs in estimation, managing of candidates interviews, cooperation with PM in monitoring project’s needs);

• Identifying and developing new business segments, preparation analysis of new opportunities for company growth on the market (market analysis; market segmentation; market research, preparation of reports on search campaigns and presentation for marketing and technical teams, running e-mail campaigns);

• Formation of value proposition (identifying and developing the company’s unique selling propositions for target clients);

• Working with technical, marketing, financial teams to develop proposal that speaks to the client’s needs, concerns, and objectives.
Looking For: Currently, I see myself as a part of a Sales/BD team where I can prove that I’m a beneficial part of a team.
I'm ready to implement my experience and also - open for new challenges helping a company growth.
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 3.0
