Position: Customer Support Manager / Customer Success Manager / Account Manager
Moreinfo: I have got 5 years' work experience with English-speaking customers in telecommunication, pharmaceutical and IT companies.

My dailly duties included: 
- interaction with customers, technical support, development of new markets; 
 - providing assistance for the customers via e-mails (OTRS, MS Outlook, Kayako); 
